            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### ২. স্টয়কিওমেট্রির মূল ভিত্তি: সমতাকৃত সমীকরণ (Balanced Equation)",
            "start": 832,
            "end": 901
          },
          {
            "id": "p16",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "স্টয়কিওমেট্রি করার প্রথম এবং প্রধান শর্ত হলো—রাসায়নিক সমীকরণটির **সমতাকরণ (Balance)** করা থাকতে হবে। কারণ *ভরের নিত্যতা সূত্র* অনুযায়ী পরমাণু কখনো ধ্বংস বা সৃষ্টি হয় না।",
            "start": 902,
            "end": 1073
          },
          {
            "id": "p17",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "একটি সহজ সমীকরণ দেখা যাক:",
            "start": 1075,
            "end": 1100
          },
          {
            "id": "p18",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "$$2H_2 + O_2 \\rightarrow 2H_2O$$",
            "start": 1101,
            "end": 1133
          },
          {
            "id": "p19",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "এই সমীকরণটি আমাদের কী তথ্য দিচ্ছে?",
            "start": 1135,
            "end": 1169
          },
          {
            "id": "p20",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **অণু হিসেবে:** ২ অণু হাইড্রোজেন ($H_2$) + ১ অণু অক্সিজেন ($O_2$) মিলে তৈরি করে ২ অণু পানি ($H_2O$)।",
            "start": 1170,
            "end": 1272
          },
          {
            "id": "p21",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **মোল হিসেবে (সবচেয়ে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ):** **২ মোল** $H_2$ + **১ মোল** $O_2$ মিলে তৈরি করে **২ মোল** $H_2O$।",
            "start": 1273,
            "end": 1379
          },
          {
            "id": "p22",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **ভর হিসেবে:**",
            "start": 1380,
            "end": 1396
          },
          {
            "id": "p23",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * ২ মোল $H_2 = 2 \\times 2 = 4\\text{ g}$",
            "start": 1397,
            "end": 1438
          },
          {
            "id": "p24",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * ১ মোল $O_2 = 1 \\times 32 = 32\\text{ g}$",
            "start": 1439,
            "end": 1482
          },
          {
            "id": "p25",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * ২ মোল $H_2O = 2 \\times 18 = 36\\text{ g}$",
            "start": 1483,
            "end": 1527
          },
          {
            "id": "p26",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  *(খেয়াল করে দেখো: বিক্রিয়কের মোট ভর $4+32 = 36\\text{ g}$, এবং উৎপাদের ভরও $36\\text{ g}$!)*",
            "start": 1528,
            "end": 1620
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The explanation of the law of conservation of mass, equation balancing, and molecular, molar, and mass interpretations of 2H2 + O2 -> 2H2O is entirely accurate.",
