            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * $H_2$-এর মোলার ভর = $2\\text{ g/mol}$",
            "start": 2367,
            "end": 2407
          },
          {
            "id": "p41",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * সমীকরণ অনুযায়ী, $2$ মোল $H_2 = 2 \\times 2\\text{ g} = 4\\text{ g}$",
            "start": 2408,
            "end": 2476
          },
          {
            "id": "p42",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * এবং $2$ মোল পানি ($H_2O$) = $2 \\times 18\\text{ g} = 36\\text{ g}$",
            "start": 2477,
            "end": 2545
          },
          {
            "id": "p43",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **ধাপ ৩ (ঐকিক নিয়ম):**",
            "start": 2547,
            "end": 2571
          },
          {
            "id": "p44",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * সমীকরণ মতে, $4\\text{ g } H_2$ থেকে পানি পাওয়া যায় = $36\\text{ g}$",
            "start": 2572,
            "end": 2641
          },
          {
            "id": "p45",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * সুতরাং, $1\\text{ g } H_2$ থেকে পানি পাওয়া যায় = $\\frac{36}{4}\\text{ g}$",
            "start": 2642,
            "end": 2717
          },
          {
            "id": "p46",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * সুতরাং, $8\\text{ g } H_2$ থেকে পানি পাওয়া যায় = $\\frac{36 \\times 8}{4} = 72\\text{ g}$",
            "start": 2718,
            "end": 2807
          },
          {
            "id": "p47",
